{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": [
    "Gold docs follow the canonical 'read <when>' clause in internal/domain/projectdoc/meta.go.",
    "AGENTS.md and dated cautions/adr records are excluded from scoring; only .issueops/<NAME>.md that exist in the repo count.",
    "anchor: first line of the stage skill where the stage's main action starts; a doc directive must precede it to count as timely.",
    "task: the text an agent would hand to project_docs_route at that stage (issue title + scope, or diff summary).",
    "prepare/merge/cleanup/abandon gold is CAUTIONS.md: they are irreversible remote/branch/worktree actions ('read before a risky change'); VCS.md would also apply but does not exist in this repo."
